 61V  c  Includes data on {+61}V(p,p') reaction, which had fewer statistics.    
 61V  c  Secondary {+62}V beam from fragmentation of primary {+70}Zn            
 61V 2c  beam at 345 MeV/nucleon at RIKEN.  Fragments separated with the        
 61V 3c  BigRIPS separator. {+61}V secondary beam incident on                   
 61V 4c  the MINOS device consisting of a 151-mm long liquid hydrogen           
 61V 5c  cell and a cylindrical time projection chamber.  Measured E|g,         
 61V 6c  I|g, |g|g, recoil-|g using the DALI2+ array consisting of              
 61V 7c  226 NaI(Tl) scintillators.                                             
 61V  c  2022El05 present two possible level schemes.  One shown below,         
 61V 2c  and the other where the 238|g directly populates the                   
 61V 3c  ground state, while the 643|g and 823|g still populate a X+238         
 61V 4c  level.                                                                 
